"<nav class=\"subnav\" aria-label=\"SoraFiles Desktop\" data-testid=\"desktop-subnav\"><div class=\"container subnav__inner\"><span class=\"eyebrow subnav__title\">SoraFiles Desktop</span><ul class=\"subnav__list\"><li><a data-testid=\"subnav-overview\" class=\"subnav__link\" href=\"/desktop\" data-discover=\"true\">Overview</a></li><li><a data-testid=\"subnav-plans\" class=\"subnav__link\" href=\"/desktop/pricing\" data-discover=\"true\">Plans</a></li><li><a data-testid=\"subnav-downloads\" class=\"subnav__link\" href=\"/desktop/download\" data-discover=\"true\">Downloads</a></li><li><a data-testid=\"subnav-releases\" class=\"subnav__link\" href=\"/desktop/releases\" data-discover=\"true\">Releases</a></li><li><a data-testid=\"subnav-help\" aria-current=\"page\" class=\"subnav__link active\" href=\"/desktop/help\" data-discover=\"true\">Help</a></li></ul></div></nav><div class=\"container page-intro\" data-testid=\"page-intro\"><h1 class=\"t-h1 page-intro__title\" data-testid=\"page-title\"><span class=\"line-reveal\"><span class=\"line-reveal__inner\" style=\"--i:0\">Desktop help</span></span></h1></div><div class=\"container doc-layout\"><nav class=\"toc\" aria-label=\"On this page\" data-testid=\"toc\"><p class=\"eyebrow eyebrow--plain toc__title\">On this page</p><ol><li><a class=\"toc__link\" data-testid=\"toc-guides\" href=\"/desktop/help#guides\" data-discover=\"true\">Desktop guides</a></li><li><a class=\"toc__link\" data-testid=\"toc-install\" href=\"/desktop/help#install\" data-discover=\"true\">Installing Desktop</a></li><li><a class=\"toc__link\" data-testid=\"toc-smartscreen\" href=\"/desktop/help#smartscreen\" data-discover=\"true\">Windows SmartScreen</a></li><li><a class=\"toc__link\" data-testid=\"toc-macos-open-anyway\" href=\"/desktop/help#macos-open-anyway\" data-discover=\"true\">Opening SoraFiles on macOS</a></li><li><a class=\"toc__link\" data-testid=\"toc-trial\" href=\"/desktop/help#trial\" data-discover=\"true\">Trial and activation</a></li><li><a class=\"toc__link\" data-testid=\"toc-license-email\" href=\"/desktop/help#license-email\" data-discover=\"true\">Can&#x27;t find your license email?</a></li><li><a class=\"toc__link\" data-testid=\"toc-cancel-subscription\" href=\"/desktop/help#cancel-subscription\" data-discover=\"true\">Cancel or change your subscription</a></li><li><a class=\"toc__link\" data-testid=\"toc-replace-device\" href=\"/desktop/help#replace-device\" data-discover=\"true\">Replacing a device</a></li><li><a class=\"toc__link\" data-testid=\"toc-promo-code\" href=\"/desktop/help#promo-code\" data-discover=\"true\">Where do I enter a promo code?</a></li><li><a class=\"toc__link\" data-testid=\"toc-web-tools\" href=\"/desktop/help#web-tools\" data-discover=\"true\">Need to work on a file now?</a></li></ol></nav><div class=\"help-sections\"><section id=\"guides\" class=\"help-section\" aria-labelledby=\"guides-title\" data-testid=\"help-guides\"><h2 id=\"guides-title\" class=\"t-h3\">Desktop guides</h2><p>New to SoraFiles Desktop? These short guides explain what it is and how it works with your file manager.</p><ul class=\"guide-links help-guides\" data-testid=\"help-guide-links\"><li><a class=\"link\" data-testid=\"help-guide-what-is-sorafiles-desktop\" href=\"/guides/what-is-sorafiles-desktop\" data-discover=\"true\">What is SoraFiles Desktop?</a></li><li><a class=\"link\" data-testid=\"help-guide-how-sorafiles-desktop-works\" href=\"/guides/how-sorafiles-desktop-works\" data-discover=\"true\">How SoraFiles Desktop works</a></li><li><a class=\"link\" data-testid=\"help-guide-getting-started-with-sorafiles-desktop\" href=\"/guides/getting-started-with-sorafiles-desktop\" data-discover=\"true\">Getting started with SoraFiles Desktop</a></li><li><a class=\"link\" data-testid=\"help-guide-use-sorafiles-from-your-file-manager\" href=\"/guides/use-sorafiles-from-your-file-manager\" data-discover=\"true\">Use SoraFiles from your file manager</a></li><li><a class=\"link\" data-testid=\"help-guide-sorafiles-web-vs-desktop\" href=\"/guides/sorafiles-web-vs-desktop\" data-discover=\"true\">SoraFiles Web vs SoraFiles Desktop</a></li><li><a class=\"link\" data-testid=\"help-guide-using-sorafiles-desktop-offline\" href=\"/guides/using-sorafiles-desktop-offline\" data-discover=\"true\">Using SoraFiles Desktop offline</a></li></ul></section><section id=\"install\" class=\"help-section\" aria-labelledby=\"install-title\" data-testid=\"help-install\"><h2 id=\"install-title\" class=\"t-h3\">Installing Desktop</h2><p>Download the installer for your operating system from <a class=\"link\" data-testid=\"help-downloads-link\" href=\"/desktop/download\" data-discover=\"true\">Downloads</a>. Verify the published SHA-256 checksum before opening it. Desktop does not update itself automatically.</p></section><span id=\"windows-unsigned\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span><section id=\"smartscreen\" class=\"help-section\" aria-labelledby=\"smartscreen-title\" data-testid=\"help-smartscreen\"><h2 id=\"smartscreen-title\" class=\"t-h3\">Windows SmartScreen</h2><p>The current Windows installer is distributed unsigned, so Microsoft Defender SmartScreen may say that Windows protected your PC. After verifying the SHA-256 checksum and confirming that you downloaded the installer from the SoraFiles release page, select More info, then Run anyway. A publisher warning may continue until SoraFiles ships a certificate-signed installer.</p></section><section id=\"macos-open-anyway\" class=\"help-section\" aria-labelledby=\"macos-open-anyway-title\" data-testid=\"help-macos-open-anyway\"><h2 id=\"macos-open-anyway-title\" class=\"t-h3\">Opening SoraFiles on macOS</h2><p>macOS may block SoraFiles the first time you open it. If you downloaded it from sorafiles.com, follow these steps:</p><ol class=\"steps\" data-testid=\"help-macos-open-anyway-steps\"><li><span class=\"steps__n tnum\" aria-hidden=\"true\">1</span><span>Open the DMG, drag SoraFiles Desktop to Applications, then try opening it once.</span></li><li><span class=\"steps__n tnum\" aria-hidden=\"true\">2</span><span>Open System Settings, select Privacy &amp; Security, and scroll to the message about SoraFiles Desktop.</span></li><li><span class=\"steps__n tnum\" aria-hidden=\"true\">3</span><span>Select Open Anyway, then confirm Open when prompted.</span></li></ol><p>This allows SoraFiles on this Mac only. If macOS says the app is damaged or will harm your computer, do not override that alert. See <a href=\"https://support.apple.com/en-us/102445\" class=\"link\" data-testid=\"help-apple-link\">Apple’s opening instructions</a>.</p></section><section id=\"trial\" class=\"help-section\" aria-labelledby=\"trial-title\" data-testid=\"help-trial\"><h2 id=\"trial-title\" class=\"t-h3\">Trial and activation</h2><p>Your free 7-day trial begins automatically when you first open SoraFiles Desktop on Windows, macOS or Linux. Connect to finish trial setup; waiting to connect does not extend the trial. To continue after the trial, choose License → Activate License and paste the key from your purchase email. File processing works offline after setup. Setup, activation and subscription renewals need an internet connection. A Lifetime license continues to work offline after activation.</p></section><section id=\"license-email\" class=\"help-section\" aria-labelledby=\"license-email-title\" data-testid=\"help-license-email\"><h2 id=\"license-email-title\" class=\"t-h3\">Can&#x27;t find your license email?</h2><p>Check the inbox for the email address used at checkout, including Spam or Junk. Look for “Your License Key is Ready” from <span class=\"tnum\">noreply@dodopayments.com</span>. If it landed in Spam, mark it as not spam. If you still cannot find it, <a class=\"link\" data-testid=\"help-contact-link\" href=\"/contact\" data-discover=\"true\">contact us</a> for help.</p></section><section id=\"cancel-subscription\" class=\"help-section\" aria-labelledby=\"cancel-subscription-title\" data-testid=\"help-cancel-subscription\"><h2 id=\"cancel-subscription-title\" class=\"t-h3\">Cancel or change your subscription</h2><p>Monthly and annual plans renew automatically until you cancel. You can cancel anytime from SoraFiles Desktop:</p><ol class=\"steps\" data-testid=\"help-cancel-subscription-steps\"><li><span class=\"steps__n tnum\" aria-hidden=\"true\">1</span><span>Open SoraFiles Desktop and choose License.</span></li><li><span class=\"steps__n tnum\" aria-hidden=\"true\">2</span><span>Select Manage or cancel subscription. The secure Dodo Payments portal opens in your browser, already signed in.</span></li><li><span class=\"steps__n tnum\" aria-hidden=\"true\">3</span><span>Choose Cancel at next billing date to keep using Desktop until the end of the period you have paid for. Cancel now ends it right away.</span></li></ol><p>You won't be charged again after cancelling. The same portal shows your invoices and lets you update your payment method. Lifetime licenses have no subscription to cancel.</p><p>No longer have Desktop installed? <a class=\"link\" data-testid=\"help-cancel-contact-link\" href=\"/contact\" data-discover=\"true\">Contact us</a> and we will cancel it for you.</p></section><section id=\"replace-device\" class=\"help-section\" aria-labelledby=\"replace-device-title\" data-testid=\"help-replace-device\"><h2 id=\"replace-device-title\" class=\"t-h3\">Replacing a device</h2><p>Open License → Replace device. SoraFiles sends a short-lived code to the purchaser email on the verified order. The address is masked in Desktop. After verification, the one-time replacement checkout opens; payment alone cannot bypass email verification.</p><table class=\"fee-table\" data-testid=\"replacement-fees\"><caption>One-time device replacement fee</caption><thead><tr><td></td><th scope=\"col\">Monthly</th><th scope=\"col\">Annual</th><th scope=\"col\">Lifetime</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope=\"row\">Personal</th><td class=\"tnum\" data-testid=\"fee-personal-monthly\">$0.99</td><td class=\"tnum\" data-testid=\"fee-personal-annual\">$0.99</td><td class=\"tnum\" data-testid=\"fee-personal-lifetime\">$19.99</td></tr><tr><th scope=\"row\">Team</th><td class=\"tnum\" data-testid=\"fee-team-monthly\">$3.99</td><td class=\"tnum\" data-testid=\"fee-team-annual\">$3.99</td><td class=\"tnum\" data-testid=\"fee-team-lifetime\">$79.99</td></tr></tbody></table><p>An unused Team seat activates without a replacement fee.</p></section><span id=\"promo-codes\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span><section id=\"promo-code\" class=\"help-section\" aria-labelledby=\"promo-code-title\" data-testid=\"help-promo-code\"><h2 id=\"promo-code-title\" class=\"t-h3\">Where do I enter a promo code?</h2><p>Enter a discount code in Dodo checkout before payment. SoraFiles Web remains free.</p></section><section id=\"web-tools\" class=\"help-section\" aria-labelledby=\"web-tools-title\" data-testid=\"help-web-tools\"><h2 id=\"web-tools-title\" class=\"t-h3\">Need to work on a file now?</h2><p><a class=\"link\" data-testid=\"help-tools-link\" href=\"/tools\" data-discover=\"true\">The free web tools</a> remain available with no Desktop purchase required.</p></section></div></div>"
